%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e28c2e20bb6c4240a55d8edffb777ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: DarryPassingOn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NewDialogueData
  npcName: Darry
  dialogueLines:
  - LineID: Start
    Speaker: Darry
    text: Thank f*#& we got away from that thing, I almost...wait...what's going
      on?
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: II
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: II
    Speaker: Darry
    text: I feel...awful. Where's Reed, and who are you?!
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: III
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices:
    - text: I'm Echo, this is the Astral Plane.
      NextLineID: Echo Good I
      moralityChange: 1
      direction: 1
      objectiveToActivate: 
    - text: Doesn't matter, what're you feeling?
      NextLineID: Echo Bad I
      moralityChange: -1
      direction: 0
      objectiveToActivate: 
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Echo Good I
    Speaker: Echo
    text: 'Uh...hi, Darry. I''m Echo, and we''re in the Astral Plane, an ''after''life''
      of sorts. '
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: III Good
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Echo Bad I
    Speaker: Echo
    text: Who I am doesn't matter. You're dead and have been for some time now, us
      being in the Astral Plane is reflective of that. I'm curious, how, or what,
      are you feeling right now?
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: III Bad
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: III Good
    Speaker: Darry
    text: The Astral Plane? What're you talking about, my house is right over...oh.
      I...see...
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: IV
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: III Bad
    Speaker: Darry
    text: Watch the attitude, kid! Also, what're you talking about 'I'm dead and
      this is the Astral plane'? Are you out of your...oh. I...uh...
    lineTone: 2
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: IV
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: IV
    Speaker: Darry
    text: I remember now...it was the night Reed and I were fighting. He went off
      on his own and I...so I'm...
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: V
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: V
    Speaker: Echo
    text: I'm not entirely sure on what happened to you on that night, but your death
      left you with some lingering regrets. Just now, I intervened and changed your
      trajectory. Now, you're free to move on from here.
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: VI
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: VI
    Speaker: Darry
    text: At what point did I forget all of my regrets and just start living here?
      Have I been living like normal, has it been the same day every day? Reed...we
      parted on such sh*$#y terms...what do I do now?
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: 
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices:
    - text: Reed still visits you, every day.
      NextLineID: Echo Good II
      moralityChange: 1
      direction: 3
      objectiveToActivate: 
    - text: Saving you was hard, you know.
      NextLineID: Echo Bad II
      moralityChange: -1
      direction: 0
      objectiveToActivate: 
    - text: I don't know what to say...
      NextLineID: Echo Neutral I
      moralityChange: -1
      direction: 1
      objectiveToActivate: 
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Echo Good II
    Speaker: Echo
    text: Listen. In the 'overworld', the original one we're from, Reed visits your
      grave every day. He misses you and cared about you deeply, just as you cared
      for him. I can't say what'll happen with that Reed, as I'm here in this plane
      with you. Here, though, you can let go of your regrets, and know that eventually,
      Reed will find you. Wherever you go.
    lineTone: 1
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: VII Good
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Echo Bad II
    Speaker: Echo
    text: That's crazy, listen. I worked my a$* off ensuring that you'd get out of
      that situation. Without me, you wouldn't be able to move on from here, or whatever
      it is you're about to do. I've afforded you something I'm not even sure is
      guaranteed for myself. All of this in mind, got something cool you can give
      me?
    lineTone: 2
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: VII Bad
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: Echo Neutral I
    Speaker: Echo
    text: Darry, I'm sorry...I don't know what to say? I'm still getting my bearings.
      I really don't know what's next for you, or if I can even offer helpful words...
    lineTone: 0
    NPCGender: female
    NextLineID: VII Neutral
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: VII Good
    Speaker: Darry
    text: ...You said your name was Echo, right? Not bad, kid. Maybe we ran into
      each other a few times back there, I hope I was always nice to you. Thank you,
      Echo, from the bottom of my 'heart'. I was blind, and knew only regret. Now,
      wherever I go, I know it'll be brighter there.
    lineTone: 1
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: VIII fine
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: VII Bad
    Speaker: Darry
    text: ...You said your name was Echo, right? F*#&. You. Whatever the reason you're
      here, I hope you're stuck. Still, thanks for changing my outcome. Now, I get
      to leave your miserable a$* here. I don't have anything cool for you, and even
      if I did, I'm not sure I'd hand it over. You should try to turn over a new
      leaf while you're here. Maybe there's hope.
    lineTone: 2
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: VIII bad
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: VII Neutral
    Speaker: Darry
    text: ...You said your name was Echo, right? You know what, that was probably
      the most human response you could've given me. Ha! Thank you, Echo. I hope
      things clear up for you in time.
    lineTone: 1
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: VIII fine
    endDialogueAfterLine: 0
    movingOn: 0
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: VIII fine
    Speaker: Darry
    text: I think it's time...I feel weightless, but safe. I'm in control. Take care,
      Echo!
    lineTone: 1
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: 
    endDialogueAfterLine: 1
    movingOn: 1
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
  - LineID: VIII bad
    Speaker: Darry
    text: I think it's time...later, kid! Enjoy being stuck here!
    lineTone: 1
    NPCGender: male
    NextLineID: VIII
    endDialogueAfterLine: 1
    movingOn: 1
    GiveItem: 0
    choices: []
    objectivesToActivate: []
